# 10. Package Installation Automation

### Debian/Ubuntu

```bash
apt update
apt install -y nginx
```

Check package:

```bash
dpkg -s nginx
```

### RHEL/CentOS

```bash
dnf install -y nginx
```

or on older systems:

```bash
yum install -y nginx
```

Check package:

```bash
rpm -q nginx
```

### Important

Your Day 17 script uses:

```bash
apt
dpkg
```

So it is specifically designed for **Debian/Ubuntu-based systems**.

It will not work as written on RHEL/CentOS.

