# 11. File and Directory Checks

```bash
[ -f "$FILE" ]    # Regular file
[ -d "$DIR" ]     # Directory
[ -e "$PATH" ]    # Exists
[ -r "$FILE" ]    # Readable
[ -w "$FILE" ]    # Writable
[ -x "$FILE" ]    # Executable
```

Example:

```bash
if [ -d "/var/log" ]; then
    echo "Log directory exists"
fi
```

